<div style="text-align: left;">
<p>The following text has been proposed to replace the expunged description of SCP-3985:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-3985 is the collective designation of fourteen humanoids who vary in terms of age, sex, and ethnicity. Additional information on SCP-3985 is available in Site-262 archives.</p>
</blockquote>
